{
 "id": 54174,
 "name": "Web Cryptography Working Group",
 "is_closed": true,
 "description": "The mission of this group is to define an API that lets developers implement secure application protocols on the level of Web applications, including message confidentiality and authentication services, by exposing trusted cryptographic primitives from the browser. Web application developers will no longer have to create their own or use untrusted third-party libraries for cryptographic primitives. This will improve security on the Web.",
